Format the C headers as maplibre-native-ffi's include/ is formatted.

include/ is the source of truth for the C API, and the configure step fails
while this copy differs from it. maplibre-native-ffi's formatter sorts the
includes of render_target.h and rewraps two comments in style.h and the
declaration of mln_web_free in web.h, which the copy here doesn't do yet.

